            </note>
            <note corresp="#d126-f3" n="3" xml:id="d126-f3-content">
                <p>Not found in Department of State files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d126-f4" n="4" xml:id="d126-f4-content">
                <p>The Department, on October 25, notified Athens that the allocation of aid funds
                    to Turkey under Public Law 793 had been increased to $50,000,000 (telegram
                        Gama 1316, 868.00/10–2548).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
